We are one of the largest
organizations that

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:17.160
collects massive
amounts of data,

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.590
and analyzes it, and uses that.

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:20.920
It's not just search, though.

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:23.460
If you look at it, we have
more than seven products.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.040
And I know I heard in
keynote earlier today we

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.720
