large scale Hadoop deployment.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:57.850
I think it was mentioned
300 petabytes of data

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:01.870
being moved into GCP and
running that scale of cluster.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:05.590
And the highlight was like
our network and our capability

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:07.870
that we provide with our
networking stack allows

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.060
you to have this
decoupling of storage

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:13.030
and compute that really
makes it easy to manage

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:15.124
the whole environment,
reduce the costs and all.

00:10:15.124 --> 00:10:16.540
So we are seeing
tremendous growth

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:19.190
with folks like Twitter,
Yahoos of the world,

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:21.580
but also a lot of
enterprise customers

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:24.680
that are using the platform.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:28.380
So with that, let me
