that the key challenge is

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:34.310
because we have operations
in various countries--

00:12:34.310 --> 00:12:37.070
Malaysia, Thailand,
Indonesia, Philippines,

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:40.550
