00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:49.640
So the data that we
need is really more on,

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:54.440
how do we improve the consumer's
experience and the revenue

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.120
that we can get
from them, and be

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.910
able to provide the right
kind of products and offerings

00:13:58.910 --> 00:13:59.720
