00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.790
And how do we use
this data to improve

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:05.900
the overall operational
efficiency of our operations

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.610
and so that we
reach productivity

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:12.440
in the most efficient
way and be able to focus

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:16.430
more of our efforts into
looking at the insights of not

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:19.040
