but also the behavior

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.030
of our consumers so we
can provide better product

00:14:22.030 --> 00:14:23.115
offerings, and so forth?

00:14:23.115 --> 00:14:23.990
SUDHIR HASBE: Got it.

