00:14:38.615 --> 00:14:39.365
AIREEN OMAR: Yeah.

00:14:39.365 --> 00:14:42.390
So I'm also in charge of
digital transformation.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:46.790
So the key thing is for us to
integrate all this data coming

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:51.320
