all those in BigQuery.

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.070
And it's a powerful
tool that allows

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:06.400
us to be scalable, and
be able to work faster,

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:11.229
and be more focused on the
