00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:36.885
Great.

00:17:36.885 --> 00:17:39.931
There are a lot of people who
don't, so my recommendation

00:17:39.931 --> 00:17:41.430
would be you should
go check it out.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.110
It will take you a
couple of minutes

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:45.630
to go actually bring your
data in and start analyzing.

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:47.426
As I said, completely
serverless.

00:17:47.426 --> 00:17:49.300
You don't have to worry
about infrastructure.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.970
Bring data in and
start analyzing.

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:52.200
That's the key thing.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:54.270
It's highly secure.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.170
We encrypt the data at rest.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.790
And it's highly available.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:01.200
And then, real-time streaming
